<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg" data-parallax="0.15"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="675" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/claim-calculator-suite/">Calculators</a></li><li aria-current="page">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator for Storm Claims</h1><p class="lede">Short measurements are one of the most common reasons roof claims come up light. Enter the footprint and pitch to estimate real surface area, squares, bundles and drip-edge footage.</p></div></section><section class="tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="calc" data-tool="roof">
<div class="calc-head"><p class="calc-title">Roof pitch & squares calculator</p><span class="calc-tag">Check the carrier’s measurements</span></div>
<div class="calc-grid">
<div class="calc-in">
<fieldset class="seg"><legend>How will you measure?</legend>
<label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="dims" checked> <span>Length × width</span></label>
<label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="area"> <span>Known footprint area</span></label></fieldset>
<div class="two" data-mode="dims"><div class="fld"><label for="r-l">Footprint length (ft)</label><input id="r-l" name="len" inputmode="decimal" value="62"></div><div class="fld"><label for="r-w">Footprint width (ft)</label><input id="r-w" name="wid" inputmode="decimal" value="36"></div></div>
<div data-mode="dims"><div class="fld"><label for="r-oh">Eave overhang (inches)</label><input id="r-oh" name="oh" inputmode="decimal" value="16"></div></div>
<div data-mode="area" hidden><div class="fld"><label for="r-a">Footprint incl. overhangs (sq ft)</label><input id="r-a" name="area" inputmode="decimal" value="2400"></div></div>
<div class="two"><div class="fld"><label for="r-p">Roof pitch (rise per 12)</label><select id="r-p" name="pitch"><option value="2">2/12</option><option value="3">3/12</option><option value="4">4/12</option><option value="5">5/12</option><option value="6">6/12</option><option value="7" selected>7/12</option><option value="8">8/12</option><option value="9">9/12</option><option value="10">10/12</option><option value="12">12/12</option><option value="14">14/12</option></select></div><div class="fld"><label for="r-wst">Roof shape / waste</label><select id="r-wst" name="waste"><option value="10">Simple gable — 10%</option><option value="13">Gable with dormers — 13%</option><option value="15" selected>Hip roof — 15%</option><option value="19">Cut-up / complex — 19%</option></select></div></div>
<div class="fld"><label for="r-pr">Installed price per square (optional, $)</label><input id="r-pr" name="price" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 540"><small class="hint">Use a local contractor’s quote for a rough figure.</small></div>
</div>
